{"id":10000043,"name":"砂糖","enName":"Sucrose","title":"无害甜度","element":"风","region":"蒙德","rarity":4,"weapon":"法器","birthday":"11月26日","constellation":"烧瓶座","description":"对万物充满好奇的炼金术士，「生物炼金」学派的研究者。","affiliation":"西风骑士团","cv":{"chinese":"小敢","japanese":"藤田茜","english":"玛雅·格雷顿","korean":"金荷英"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000043-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000043-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Sucrose.zip","voicePackageEn":"Sucrose","quoteCount":70,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"我是砂糖，炼金术的…研究员。听说你去过很多地方，一定也…不，没什么，第一次见面，不该这么麻烦你。但…如果你愿意，和我讲讲路上有意思的事，那个…我，会很开心的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/07iaqn3b6uufi55x5hy0nr0ijgsfdqo.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·好奇","desc":"那是什么？啊…不见了，我可以去看看吗！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_explore_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/q02hl4p9d2pq03devhortkvao53e0cn.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·整理","desc":"趁现在，赶快整理一下研究笔记…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_explore_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b4/1a9i5zcrh8t8uc7kcl6s4cs0p40ib2l.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·深呼吸","desc":"嗯——！好久没出来透气了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_explore_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/38/0kehtgdehu4bbi8uih7zburr8jmxg2c.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"今天城里的风车，转得好快。欸，你说，如果在小动物背上，也装一个像风车一样的东西，会让它们跑得更快呢，还是会飞起来呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8b/fxx6efc2ugsc3rmyk2ywizo51frcy2n.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"这么大的雪，一年都没有几次，错过了，想研究就要等明年了，所以就别拦我啦。啊…阿嚏！呃…我知道了，我多穿一点…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/qreqzllzg2t6ufko9w1bdt0wyacmq9g.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"天…天已经亮了？！那、那再做最后一次实验吧，做完就休息！嗯，最后一次…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/2kt6xh3pmt15rxey48663dulyrfv5qn.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"湿度上升，嗯…要不要再加一组实验呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/61/ojnus1m7322ekfh8u6ai83rwu7pl8bs.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早上好，昨晚睡得还好吗？研究表明，只有睡眠充足，第二天的精神才会好，而且，脑袋的运转也会更高效哦。欸…什么？我总是熬夜？那个…唔，没办法嘛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/q5ouv0kwz9cx9m88dixqqya4k8j9wap.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"呜哇！别、别过来！啊…不是，我的意思是，不要靠得太近，我在做实验，这个…可能会爆炸的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/jer2bq0bwi2q3w41jmuspqd33wcdg8p.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"晚上好，啊…请稍等一下！「实验体玖零伍式」的光照分泌物其实有两种，为了明确区分，就叫「壹零叁叁式」和「壹零叁伍式」…嗯，好了，请问有什么事情要找我吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/29/35v4uz9hy8dmsova2xeb032n7mz1z06.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"不用等我，先去休息吧。唔…有这么不放心吗？实验已经在收尾了，不会熬夜的，真的…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/cmr8dlk3b7vdeoqlys8ncvqw9qkw81b.mp3"},{"title":"关于砂糖自己·「生物炼金」","desc":"「生物炼金」，比起「创造」，更注重「改造」，找到生物隐藏起来的优点，然后放大，结合，结果往往都让人大吃一惊。嗯…生命真的是太神奇了，究竟还有多少我们不知道的东西呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/5x588fow2fpyt2qoumd93dp2hmn0oge.mp3"},{"title":"关于砂糖自己·怕生","desc":"我…其实我不知道怎么和陌生人说话。每个人性格都不一样，在意的东西也不一样，一不小心就会不够礼貌，或者哪里冒犯了，唉…说话真的好难啊，比炼金术什么的难多了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/3xybbz1arji9drlpgki5xqd4joym4s5.mp3"},{"title":"关于砂糖自己·耳朵","desc":"你…你注意到了啊。我的耳朵是家里遗传下来的，和其他人很不一样，所以平时我都会用头发尽量把它们藏起来…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_idle3","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2c/jvk4csp8cbna2boig9jqn0ybvqhc8kp.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·观察","desc":"我对你的经历，特别好奇，所以…我可以「观察」你一段时间吗？我会很安静的，不会打扰你，这样…你会介意吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/59wz0jckl6yap046qicae7nsx0qhoh1.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·收获","desc":"老实说，一开始我看你不怎么说话，有点害怕…还以为是在哪里冒犯了你，后来时间长了才慢慢发现，原来，你还是挺好相处的。嘿嘿，这也算…「观察」的意外收获吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/08vxeuwod5wb8khhn7ck8oni14ml411.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·请求","desc":"听说，是你赶走了风魔龙？战斗一定特别危险吧，幸好你没事。那个…有件小事，风魔龙它在战斗的时候，有没有，掉下来什么东西呢？鳞也好，皮也好，一点点就可以，我想，研究一下…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_close2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/88cpl9mvyu0yfacycnfsgkowky57hvf.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"「神之眼」，是我最重要的实验器材。欸？就、就是实验器材啊，没有了「神之眼」，很多跟元素相关的实验，就没办法进行了。你说战斗？啊…偶尔吧，去野外找材料的时候，偶尔会用到。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_pendant_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/04/4binyrq41r9o7y3zpg518m5ij64k9o0.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"这个房间里，都是我收藏的骨头。放在左边柜子里的，有蜥蜴，青蛙，还有草鱼，挂在前面的是野猪，右边角落里的那个，是丘丘人…啊，别紧张，不用害怕，其实都是很可爱的东西，习惯了就好了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_share","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/64/inhpt9rrw5ojx3twcybwohj7d0nm31j.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"你看，种在这里的冰雾花，其实每一朵都不一样。这一朵冰元素含量更高，这一朵花期更长…嗯？你问那一朵，哦，那一朵叫「叁式冰雾花改十七号放大版」，特点，嗯…就是更大一点。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7d/kmysyh1p8wgya41hih2dg1e4o0rhvpp.mp3"},{"title":"关于诺艾尔…","desc":"她…经常会主动帮我的忙，但有时候太热情了，反而…让我有点苦恼。有一次，她看到我实验室门前堆了三箱器材，就很麻利地帮我搬了进来，但其实…那些都是我刚刚搬出去的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_noel_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a8/4j1y9q0phwa6nydw8hnhggfrv61ls39.mp3"},{"title":"关于可莉…","desc":"她已经被琴团长关过好多次禁闭了，但只要被放出来，不久就又会闯祸，唉，不知道有没有真的反省过。啊…我答应她，要帮她做一个会蹦会跳，又很安全的蹦蹦，只不过现在，设计上还有不少问题…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_klee_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/80/tbw4am1qhert0kb6ewzhem2wayux858.mp3"},{"title":"关于琴…","desc":"我有点不敢和琴团长说话，因为她太严肃了…我知道她是个很好的人，但、但知道归知道，害怕…还是会害怕。我一般都不会去打扰她，实在有不得不找她的事，我…我也会拜托阿贝多先生。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_qin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/cdx2rozh34ypkf2wqs0hyqcuth0v6x9.mp3"},{"title":"关于丽莎…","desc":"我觉得她，好像懂的特别多。她明明没有看过我的研究，但有好几次，都给了我最关键的建议。她到底是怎么知道的呢？是…观察？还是推理呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_lisa_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c1/e31iacenda35nx7moyvjdh07lurlduq.mp3"},{"title":"关于凯亚…","desc":"唔…我知道他喜欢开玩笑，也没有存心捉弄我的意思。可是，我实在是…分不清他的哪句话是真话，哪句话又是玩笑，所以最后要不然就变得很尴尬，要不然，就是我出洋相…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_kaeya_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/brynu2qv7xjv6j4ti3he4cx6mcx98q9.mp3"},{"title":"关于阿贝多·艺术","desc":"当他的助手，每天都能学到很多。重点不是知识，而是「天才」的思考方法，无论是多么复杂的问题，他总能抽丝剥茧，再一一解决。在我看来，那就是艺术…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_albedo_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f6/dvktdbz9b5qfb9nmbj8bvjoiybsqkv6.mp3"},{"title":"关于阿贝多·天赋","desc":"你说天赋？嗯…假如和他做同样的研究，可能确实一辈子都没法超过他。但，我研究「生物炼金」并没有故意要躲开他的意思，只是…嗯，我和他恰好有不同的爱好，还有梦想，仅此而已吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_albedo_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ea/63hsaack8nqe0zhg8tn3ydr0n6ycajd.mp3"},{"title":"关于安柏…","desc":"我很好奇，为什么她做的布偶，名字叫「兔兔伯爵」呢？和兔子没什么关系吧。唔…你说，头上的发带，很像兔耳朵？…有道理，但其实这是刻板印象，也有很多兔子耳朵是垂下来的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_ambor_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/rg0huljp4kkai0d92tyv4toiev0zzcc.mp3"},{"title":"关于菲谢尔…","desc":"你是说《菲谢尔皇女夜谭》？我知道，作者创造出的世界很有意思，要是能亲眼去看一看就好了…欸？你在说那个「菲谢尔」啊？她啊…嗯，她…应该是没办法带我去的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_fischl_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/21/67at7ff3fyt3c49646om1zib3aw4o2b.mp3"},{"title":"关于优菈…","desc":"游击骑士的工作很危险，优菈小姐的行动又格外大胆，所以我给她制作了一个侦察装置，这样她就不用潜入敌人的营地了。但优菈小姐的气势太吓人，我有点怕她，告诉她使用方法的时候，不小心漏掉了几条注意事项，结果真的发生了意外…\n怎么办？我会不会被她记仇了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_teammate_eula_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/eyrhgwimpgx5t760bjer5qo5kgyz0jx.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解砂糖·其一","desc":"了解我？你…是对「生物炼金」感兴趣吗？你有疑问的话，我会尽量给你准确答案的。嗯？不是炼金，而是「我」？唔，这个，我也不知道该说什么…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/daz97tg4ulek45wl2ujp57bmmkyr0ts.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解砂糖·其二","desc":"研究的本质，是寻找答案的过程。这个过程有时候很繁琐，也很累，但每次只要看看积累起来的成果，就会觉得…嗯，我是真的很喜欢做这样的事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/pp16nm9814eh7yueku7jgw308iw9c7p.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解砂糖·其三","desc":"小时候，我有两个好朋友，我们无话不说。本来我以为，我对她们了解得一清二楚，但后来发生了一些事，我突然就…看不透她们了。她们现在在哪儿，在做什么，还记不记得我，这些…我都不知道。就算再好的朋友，也会变成这样呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/5q1daoshd1b5v01a0ovkzrvzfmd969y.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解砂糖·其四","desc":"告诉你一个小秘密，我对谁都没有讲过。「生物炼金」的最终目标，是创造出「仙境」…对，就是童话里的那个，能找到永远的快乐与幸福的「仙境」。嘿嘿，有点幼稚对吧？但，我现在都还相信那个故事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/8tlzaemgr3xnujk3ba2fkfu7s01eb4b.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解砂糖·其五","desc":"嗯…如果你忙的话，就去忙吧，我不想给你添麻烦。不忙？真的不忙吗？没事的，就算忙也没关系，一个人做实验我早就习惯了。啊…真、真的不忙？那…那可不可以，帮帮我的忙？或者…只是陪我说说话，什么的…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/po8ug6sp01xxknzah0c396b0lfvg3tb.mp3"},{"title":"砂糖的爱好…","desc":"我喜欢看起来很规则的东西，你看，书架上每一本实验记录，厚度都是一样的，实验台上的几百瓶药水，都是按功效与颜色分别排好…欸？…欸欸？！为什么这瓶紫色的药水会出现在这里！我、我要全部整理一遍！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/1d8ea3lw3i8920yrtcrkxv4q6iemtca.mp3"},{"title":"砂糖的烦恼…","desc":"我想知道，你平时休息的时候，会干些什么呢？每到休息日，我就找不到事情做，只能发呆…明明做实验的时候时间过得很快，休息的时候，怎么就有种度日如年的感觉…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/ska9ha2u87rnjhft3b9mqbu4031dn71.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"我会提炼出甜甜花的花蜜，做成糖块。脑袋转不动的时候吃一块，就又可以集中精神了。做研究，糖分的补充是很重要的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/q2q0yonyaaqa33wmi29icl3tw9rybut.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"知道了很多「生物炼金」的知识之后，我就不怎么吃蘑菇了…你应该知道吧？蘑菇，是长在死掉的生物上的，联想到同类的其他东西，我、我的胃口就…呃…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/egw6uevpm0hk6wz6pbha8b5remg9yu5.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"好吃！啊…趁着现在状态最好，赶紧把研究做完…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/gmdh0grbc0tqtzir34f6er403uvfkdc.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"比我做的营养餐好吃了不少。嗯，我也算改善伙食了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/5hmobjxid77iui2gdxjpq55232unuy7.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"对不起。我对这道菜，还是有点…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/fq1k34enbml00rz6x43eo7vc0wet2y5.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐！我做了好几个月的实验，终于，可以把这个药水送给你了。它能唤醒你这一年来最美好的回忆，名字叫做「生物秘药叁玖壹陆号」…唔，不是「叁壹玖陆号」，是「叁玖壹陆号」啦！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c1/e4g9tvuk6pndq5h7oc3gg39e13xnwby.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"「生物炼金」的研究，终于有突破了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fb/prfei6rjzv6g8yzw7t26026hdkihf01.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"这次旅行，我又收集到了很多研究材料，谢谢你，我会好好利用的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/5frhvfx5egkw3icidyomhhsprkhyn0q.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"最近我在做实验的时候，经常会莫名地期待起来，什么时候又可以和你一起去冒险。唔…好奇怪，这是为什么呢？我要研究看看。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/h478za6uzoex555r6ncqdclvc3z0tov.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"我收集到的研究材料，已经很足够了！花更多时间在我的身上，会…会很浪费的！至少…也让我用「生物炼金」，做点什么回礼给你！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9b/pkt3z31b30nxa3qufg1ynkjua3i6ect.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"吸附力测试。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/77/6m3a7tfmhozt76xbzrzcjf0fow19yam.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"陆叁零捌式风单元！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/n191qjv6alfupwwd2d54nrc73mpoecd.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"确认…安全距离！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/jkhvfdku21tnd8pcjj7pc9dz1fznsq1.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"超扩散态！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/dr83q9r9754fn92qogseqce0qfcbcg2.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"柒伍式超级风模块！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d2/kt2g7wxm7x8dfu9i94mm4nbjy0tlffa.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"无相之风…拟造！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/59/firccdp8r9ymb6j1a9e9o3qn298lpzo.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"宝箱的出现成因…也值得研究。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/bpzjj1sghwjeslvsmkzqktqqrchkxmg.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"真希望实验材料也能成箱出现啊。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/65/nz54htmgqqd05s0bsly5lnopgm4qs10.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"太好了，有这么多素材！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/6c3fbesw0eh7lpiokm9r9tgqufn6puw.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"这种误差，还能接受…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2d/3k8fc1ztdpoi9cizcrxw2zjcog88vmo.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"有点，超出预想…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/n0m3n74i5m4o9m0s14gdt77qubx0wkg.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"不痛不痛，不痛的…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/01/6dcik8gdwidhvx77l47yf74bcnmghc4.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"快回来，我这里有药水！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/75/1jvkghg2kaxgshy0v5qcl5n0iom7at7.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"小心点，看准了再上！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/dhysqrjuza6y1uils6pvkxwybf4td9x.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"研究…又失败了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/pvsdnmmnex24yibgl6dy4sdnvxdfjjv.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"还需要…调整。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/btptf6g1nu9xro1lue48scqj01ke5tn.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"该…睡一会儿了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6a/286lw2rl3njtm9izrvgdr23vgeoa3tg.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"不应该啊…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/ljt54hs0rj4y0edzxoa3j8z5td1z8ia.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"眼镜会碎掉的！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_sucrose/vo_sucrose_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/98/b0f875t5yfvmbuhixf4nu70an0aar0c.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"希望能帮上忙…","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_sucrose_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/01/tp5c98bg9nmqzlausa7yze38e8t6bwn.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"我、我会努力的！","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_sucrose_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2f/691exzddyvois7llefpmt1th90nf558.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"实验…一定要成功。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_sucrose_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/rmv7762cbj429kh14y9ighuzy30be68.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000043-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000043-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1154,"fullArtHeight":971}